        "note": "Restless Dead interaction candidate after the first v0.1 playtest. One black mana answers a one-toughness creature immediately; a creature dying that turn upgrades it into a much larger toughness reduction. Fits necromantic death flavor and can follow a block, sacrifice, or Shambling Ghast death.",
