        "note": "Stitched Together priority interaction candidate: grave-cold locks a creature for its next untap and replaces itself with a card. Costs 1U while a Zombie is controlled. Compare replacing Think Twice: the slot still draws a card but also buys time against a large attacker or opens an attack.",
        "caution": "Temporary control, not removal. Tapping before attackers are declared can prevent that attack; tapping an already-attacking creature does not remove it from combat. Existing Compelling Deterrence, Essence Scatter, Sleep Paralysis, and Stitched Mangler already make blue comparatively interactive; this is a refinement, not evidence that all eight packs need identical changes.",
        "manaNote": "2U normally, 1U with any Zombie; one blue pip either way.",
